Dear Coordinators and Students,

Greetings from the All India Council for Technical Education (AICTE).

This is an official communication regarding the Smart India Hackathon (SIH) 2026 campus internal hackathon evaluation round. Participating teams must adhere to the 6-member guidelines (with mandatory female representation) and upload their preliminary problem statement presentations before the scheduled deadline.

Official problem statements and submission portal: https://sih.gov.in

Best wishes for your campus innovation rounds.

Innovation Cell,
All India Council for Technical Education (AICTE), New Delhi
